{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"plough","model_identifier":"plough","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## plough\n\nWorker tool / implement, iron and steel tiers.\n\n- Cubes: 13 (3 rotated). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -6.1..6.1, y 0.0..25.9, z -38.5..23.1 (size 12.2 x 25.9 x 61.6 u = 34 x 73 x 173 cm).\nWalking plough (iron grades, steel): oak beam, sole and standard, metal share, coulter and an angled mouldboard (one rotated cube), two rising handles at the back (2 rotated cubes) joined by a rung. About 1.6 m (59 u) long, stands on the ground at y = 0 facing -Z with the share forward. Not a hand-slot item: a worker walks behind it with hands at `slot_grip_r` / `slot_grip_l` (handle ends, 25.5 u up, 22 u behind the origin, so a 60 u worker stands with hips ~10 u behind them). Hitch point `slot_harness_point` at the front ring of the beam for an ox or horse harness. Team-colour stripe on the beam.\n- Embedded texture: iron_bloom. Tier textures: iron_bloom, iron_wrought, iron_refined, steel, hq_steel.\n- Slots: slot_harness_point (0, 13, -38), slot_grip_r (5.5, 25.5, 22), slot_grip_l (-5.5, 25.5, 22).\n\n- Variant textures (same UV layout): `plough_iron_bloom.png`, `plough_iron_wrought.png`, `plough_iron_refined.png`, `plough_steel.png`, `plough_hq_steel.png`\n"},"description":"## plough\n\nWorker tool / implement, iron and steel tiers.\n\n- Cubes: 13 (3 rotated). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -6.1..6.1, y 0.0..25.9, z -38.5..23.1 (size 12.2 x 25.9 x 61.6 u = 34 x 73 x 173 cm).\nWalking plough (iron grades, steel): oak beam, sole and standard, metal share, coulter and an angled mouldboard (one rotated cube), two rising handles at the back (2 rotated cubes) joined by a rung. About 1.6 m (59 u) long, stands on the ground at y = 0 facing -Z with the share forward. Not a hand-slot item: a worker walks behind it with hands at `slot_grip_r` / `slot_grip_l` (handle ends, 25.5 u up, 22 u behind the origin, so a 60 u worker stands with hips ~10 u behind them). Hitch point `slot_harness_point` at the front ring of the beam for an ox or horse harness. Team-colour stripe on the beam.\n- Embedded texture: iron_bloom. Tier textures: iron_bloom, iron_wrought, iron_refined, steel, hq_steel.\n- Slots: slot_harness_point (0, 13, -38), slot_grip_r (5.5, 25.5, 22), slot_grip_l (-5.5, 25.5, 22).\n\n- Variant textures (same UV layout): `plough_iron_bloom.png`, `plough_iron_wrought.png`, `plough_iron_refined.png`, `plough_steel.png`, `plough_hq_steel.png`\n","resolution":{"width":64,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"beam","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-1.0,12.0,-37.0],"to":[1.0,14.5,8.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[3,59,5.0,61.5],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0,53,45.0,55.5],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[5,59,7.0,61.5],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0,56,45.0,58.5],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,0,2.0,45.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[2,0,4.0,45.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"9f17ef34-c669-53ae-9097-652bac375680"},{"name":"hitch_ring","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-1.25,11.5,-38.5],"to":[1.25,15.0,-37.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[19,45,21.5,48.5],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[25,45,26.5,48.5],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[22,45,24.5,48.5],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[27,45,28.5,48.5],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[8,62,10.5,63.5],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[11,62,13.5,63.5],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"71416db7-a948-5654-ae23-f45b7b57e140"},{"name":"sole","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","all